Key Instrumentation
- Amplified Hydro-Marimba: Barred wood percussion fitted with piezo pickups, dipped periodically into river water to alter pitch and resonance.
- Bow-EBow Fender Stratocaster: Guitars played simultaneously with violin bows and electromagnetic sustainers to create endless, star-ward sheets of feedback.
- Plasma Arc Synthesizer: Custom oscillators tuned to translate real-time ionospheric flare emissions into deep sub-bass rumbles.
- Bowed Glass Sounding Bowls: Crystal bowls struck with mallets to ground the highest celestial frequencies.

